@*
    Shared "Upload evidence" dialog for the Evidence Center item form.

    Extracted verbatim from Views/Practice/Partials/evidence-center.cshtml
    (migration 499): Operationalize's one-time evidence and Complete Task's
    evidence both offer Direct Upload, and Direct Upload used to be a bare
    file picker -- the file reached the Evidence Center with no title,
    type, validity, classification, tags or owner, and the operator had to
    describe it a second time on the Evidence Center screen.

    All three screens now open THIS dialog, so there is exactly one
    "Upload evidence" form in the product and one validation rule (the
    file is required, everything else optional). Make a field mandatory
    here and it is mandatory everywhere, which is what sir asked for.

    Same arrangement as Partials/_evidence-picker-dialog.cshtml +
    wwwroot/js/Shared/evidence-picker.js: include this partial once on a
    page, load wwwroot/js/Shared/evidence-upload.js, and call
    window.gracEvidenceUpload.open({ ... }). The HOST passes the submit
    call, so the dialog never knows which endpoint stores the file --
    the Evidence Center posts to its own /upload, Operationalize and
    Complete Task post to their own attachments endpoints (which carry
    the metadata through to sp_evidence_item_store since 499).

    The element ids are unchanged from the Evidence Center original, so
    nothing that already referenced them had to move.
*@

@* ======================= Upload / edit ======================= *@
<div class="pm-modal" id="ecEditModal" hidden>
    <div class="pm-modal-panel">
        <header>
            <h2 id="ecEditTitle">Upload evidence</h2>
            <button class="pm-modal-close" type="button" data-close-ec="ecEditModal" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </header>
        <form id="ecEditForm" class="pm-form-grid">
            <label class="full" id="ecEdFileRow"><span>File *</span><input type="file" id="ecEdFile" /></label>
            <label class="full" id="ecEdVersionNoteRow" hidden><span>What changed</span><input type="text" id="ecEdVersionNote" maxlength="1000" /></label>
            <label class="full" data-ec-meta><span>Title</span><input type="text" id="ecEdTitle" maxlength="300" placeholder="Defaults to the file name" /></label>
            <label data-ec-meta><span>Evidence type</span><select id="ecEdType"><option value="">--</option></select></label>
            <label data-ec-meta><span>Owner</span><select id="ecEdOwner"><option value="">Me</option></select></label>
            <label data-ec-meta><span>Valid from</span><input type="date" id="ecEdValidFrom" /></label>
            <label data-ec-meta><span>Valid to</span><input type="date" id="ecEdValidTo" /></label>
            <label data-ec-meta><span>Classification</span><select id="ecEdClass">
                <option value="Internal">Internal</option>
                <option value="Confidential">Confidential</option>
                <option value="Restricted">Restricted (owner and admins only)</option>
            </select></label>
            <label data-ec-meta><span>Tags</span><input type="text" id="ecEdTags" maxlength="500" placeholder="Comma separated" /></label>
            <label class="full" data-ec-meta><span>Description</span><textarea id="ecEdDescription" rows="3" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label>
            <p class="ec-note full" id="ecEdNote"></p>
            <p class="pm-message full" id="ecEditMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            @* 409 from the upload: the identical file is already in the Evidence Center. *@
            <div class="pm-message info full" id="ecEdDuplicate" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
                <span id="ecEdDuplicateText"></span>
                <div class="ec-actions" style="margin:8px 0 0">
                    <button type="button" class="pm-button" id="ecEdDupOpen"><i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open"></i> Open existing</button>
                    <button type="button" class="pm-button" id="ecEdDupUpload"><i class="fa-solid fa-upload"></i> Upload as a separate item</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <footer class="pm-modal-footer full">
                <button type="button" class="pm-button" data-close-ec="ecEditModal">Cancel</button>
                <button type="submit" class="pm-button primary" id="ecEdSubmit"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save</button>
            </footer>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

